WEBVTT

c1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.444
A honeybee visits a

c2
00:00:01.444 --> 00:00:02.689
flower and sips its

c3
00:00:02.689 --> 00:00:03.600
nectar.

c4
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:04.292
In the hive,

c5
00:00:04.292 --> 00:00:05.215
bees pass it on

c6
00:00:05.215 --> 00:00:06.138
and fan it with

c7
00:00:06.138 --> 00:00:07.200
their wings.

c8
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:08.171
The water dries off,

c9
00:00:08.171 --> 00:00:09.143
it thickens into honey,

c10
00:00:09.143 --> 00:00:10.114
and they seal it

c11
00:00:10.114 --> 00:00:11.200
with wax.

